## Dynamixel motion limits — pending measured values

### Confirmed current limits

- Base, XH540-W270-T, ID 1: 5506.43 mA; raw position increases counter-clockwise.
- Wrist yaw, MX-106T, ID 3: 6877.92 mA; raw position increases counter-clockwise.
- EE/gripper, MX-106T, ID 4: 6877.92 mA; raw position increases counter-clockwise and closes the gripper.

### Still required before controller/URDF/MoveIt changes

- Velocity Limit and operating mode for IDs 1, 3, and 4.
- Current Limit, Velocity Limit, and operating mode for wrist roll, MX-106R ID 2.
- Low-speed physical validation that EE raw increase closes the gripper.
- Do not change ROS 2 control, URDF, or MoveIt velocity/effort limits until
  the remaining values are supplied and reviewed.
